  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Accountable Grant for State Information Centre and other national organizations related to Community and Capacity Building Workshops and Trainings is a component of Global Knowledge on Climate Change Adapttion: Lessons from China reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;787,284. This project benefits Far East Asia, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
